OL,3,GNEWSANine new affordable housing sites
OL,4,Arecommended
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine new sites could be designated for
OL,7,Faffordable housing as part of a review
OL,8,Fof Guernsey's Island Development Plan
OL,9,F(IDP).
OL,11,FThe plan dictates where things can be
OL,12,Fbuilt on the island and the general
OL,13,Flaws around planning in Guernsey.
OL,15,FThe recommendations from the
OL,16,FDevelopment and Planning Authority
OL,17,F(DPA) do not line up with those of the
OL,18,Findependent planning inspector.
